# NoteBuddy project rules

- This is one application developed progressively across Exercises 1–5, not five separate applications.
- Keep the browser dependent only on same-origin `/api` routes.
- Keep Retrieval, LLM, Data, Chroma, and Ollama private to the backend/container network.
- Preserve citation metadata (`source`, `page`, `section`, `chunk_index`, and `citation`) through ingestion and retrieval.
- Do not generate a grounded answer when retrieval returns no evidence.
- Do not expose secrets or internal service URLs in browser messages.
- Run `pytest -q` after backend changes and validate `compose.yaml` after deployment changes.
- The static UI must remain plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
